# Local environment files can contain credentials; keep example templates tracked.
# **/.env
# !.env.example

# Python environments, bytecode, and test caches are generated locally.
# **/.venv/
# **/__pycache__/
# **/.pytest_cache/
# *.py[cod]

# JavaScript dependencies and compiled build output can be reinstalled/regenerated.
# **/node_modules/
# **/dist/
# **/build/
# **/.astro/
